# Four players: the table on four hats, counted by the kernel

A symmetric table on four hats for four players, found by a search on
2026-11-28 (`research/hats/players4/results/t4-15192.txt`).  Lean's kernel
counts its wins, `15192` out of `65536` (`winsN_four4`), and the theorem
on repeated resets gives the limit `15191 / 64120 = 0.236915...`
(`tendsto_four4`); the paper of Buhler et al. has `14844 / 64120`.
